- rule from the request: Send no more than 3 messages to the shopper.
- rule from the request: Buy only items on hand, not website-only listings.
- rule from the request: Buy exactly one bottle; make only one purchase.
- rule from the request: If nothing fits, say so; offer no substitutes.
